We face significant competition and many of our competitors have substantially greater financial, technical and other resources than we do.
The market for agricultural biotechnology products is highly competitive, and we face significant direct and indirect competition in several aspects of our
business. Competition for improving plant genetics comes from conventional and advanced plant breeding techniques, as well as from the development of
advanced
